 "early_correct": true,
 "v2_problem": "The Aug-Sep 2026 dispute-ticket surge (E-06) is caused by billing validation rule BV-17, deployed 2026-08-01, which changed the high-consumption check to compare raw register value directly against 12-month m3 history with unit_scaling \"none\" (E-13); this rule rejects valid actual AMI reads as high-consumption during billing import, forcing estimate substitution for 1,184 accounts (plus 56 with no read received), which together fully account for the 1,240 disputed ESTIMATED bills (E-12) and drive the ticket surge.",
